# Layout and Page Patterns

**Trigger**: Auto-applied to all `.tsx` files in `src/app/`.

## Dashboard Page Layout

Dashboard page files (`src/app/(dashboard)/dashboard/page.tsx`) are Server Components. They must:

1. Fetch data server-side
2. Pass data to Client Components for rendering
3. NOT contain client-side logic

### Dashboard Page Template

```tsx
// Server Component
import { auth } from "@/lib/auth";
import { prisma } from "@/lib/prisma";
import { CalendarPreview } from "@/components/dashboard/calendar-preview";
import { RecentPostsList } from "@/components/dashboard/recent-posts-list";

export default async function DashboardPage() {
  const session = await auth();
  const userId = session?.user?.id;

  const [posts, scheduledPosts] = await Promise.all([
    prisma.post.findMany({ where: { userId }, take: 10, orderBy: { createdAt: "desc" } }),
    prisma.post.findMany({ where: { userId, status: "SCHEDULED" }, orderBy: { scheduledAt: "asc" } }),
  ]);

  return (
    <div className="space-y-6">
      <CalendarPreview posts={scheduledPosts} />
      <RecentPostsList posts={posts} />
    </div>
  );
}
```

### Dashboard Layout Template

```tsx
// src/app/(dashboard)/layout.tsx — Server Component
